#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/05_uskok_and_the_doge/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Nehaj fortress in Senj was finished in 1558 on the ruins of churches, monasteries and houses "
"outside the town walls, as a base for the uskoks."
